### 🔒 Security & Compliance

- **RBAC Enforcement:** All endpoints check permissions before execution
- **Immutable Audit Trail:** PlatformCommand records are append-only (verified in tests)
- **No PII Exposure:** Health metrics only contain aggregate counts
- **CSV Export Limits:** Capped at 100K records to prevent memory issues
- **TTL Enforcement:** Impersonation sessions expire automatically
- **Reason Validation:** Minimum 10 characters (enforced backend + frontend)
- **Ticket Requirement:** All impersonation sessions require ticket number

---

### ⚡ Performance & Reliability

- **SSE Heartbeats:** 30-second intervals detect dead connections
- **Auto-Reconnection:** Browser EventSource API handles reconnects with exponential backoff
- **Health Metrics:** Sub-200ms query time (Prometheus aggregation)
- **CSV Streaming:** Direct byte array response (no file system writes)
- **Real-time Updates:** 5-second refresh rate for dashboard metrics

